:: Hospital Emergency Contact
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>>
<<set _contact to hospitalContact() or "Bailey">>
<<generate1>><<person1>>
The receptionist opens your patient file and turns the screen slightly away from you while <<he>> checks the details.
After reading for a few seconds, <<he>> points to one of the entries.
<br><br>
"Your emergency contact is listed as <<= _contact>>," <<he>> says.
"If you're brought here and need someone to take you home, we'll call them."
<br><br>
<<if _contact isnot "Bailey">>
	<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Put Bailey back as your contact|Hospital Emergency Contact]]>><<unset $hospitalContact>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<for _name range hospitalContactOptions()>>
	<<if _name isnot _contact>>
		<<capture _name>>
			<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link `"Name " + _name + " as your contact"` "Hospital Emergency Contact">><<set $hospitalContact to _name>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</capture>>
	<</if>>
<</for>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Return to foyer|Hospital Foyer]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Widgets Hospital Emergency Contact [widget]
<<widget "hospitalContactPickup">>
<<set _contact to hospitalContact()>>
<<npc _contact>><<person1>>
<<switch _contact>>
<<case "Robin">>
	Robin is sitting in the lobby with a bag of clothes resting on <<his>> knees. As soon as <<he>> sees you,
	<<he>> stands and hurries across the room, almost leaving the bag behind on the chair.
	<br><br>
	"They called me, so I came straight here," <<he>> says as <<he>> puts <<his>> arms around you.
	<br><br>
	After the hug, <<he>> picks up the bag and holds it out to you. "I brought some clothes from your room.
	I only took what I thought you'd need. I didn't look through anything else, I promise."
	<br><br>
	Once you are ready to leave, Robin takes your hand and stays beside you all the way back to the orphanage.
	<<He>> keeps watching your face as you walk, asking several times whether you feel dizzy or need to stop and sit down.
	<br><br>
	At the orphanage door, <<he>> keeps hold of your hand. "If you start feeling ill again, come and find me, okay?
	Even if it's late." <<He>> waits until you agree before finally letting you go inside.
	<<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove "Robin">>
<<case "Whitney">>
	Whitney is sitting across two lobby chairs with a carrier bag resting on <<his>> stomach.
	When <<he>> notices you, <<he>> sits up, grabs the bag, and throws it towards you.
	<br><br>
	"Clothes," <<he>> says. "Get changed, slut. This place fucking stinks,
	and I've been sitting here waiting for your filthy ass."
	<br><br>
	After you change, Whitney heads towards the exit without asking whether you are ready.
	<<He>> stays a few steps in front of you on the way back,
	but keeps turning around to check that you are still following.
	<br><br>
	When someone looks at you for too long, <<he>> turns towards them. "What the fuck are you staring at?!"
	<br><br>
	At the orphanage, <<he>> puts a hand against your back and pushes you towards the entrance.
	"Get inside. And don't make the hospital call me again, slut. It's fucking embarrassing."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> remains outside until you have gone through the door, then turns and walks away.
	<<npcincr Whitney love 1>><<glove "Whitney">>
<<case "Kylar">>
	Kylar is walking back and forth outside the ward with a rucksack pressed against <<his>> chest.
	The instant <<he>> sees you, <<he>> stops and hurries over.
	<br><br>
	"You're okay," <<he>> says. <<He>> reaches for your arm, then grips it with both hands. "You're okay.
	They said you could leave, so that means you're okay, right? I brought clothes. Your clothes.
	I know which ones fit you."
	<br><br>
	Kylar stays close beside you on the walk home, keeping one hand around your arm. Whenever a car passes nearby,
	<<he>> moves closer to you and watches it until it has gone past.
	<br><br>
	When you reach the orphanage, <<he>> follows you right up to the door.
	<<He>> keeps hold of your sleeve after you turn towards the entrance, then slowly releases it.
	<br><br>
	"You'll tell me if something happens again, won't you?" <<he>> asks. "You won't just disappear?"
	<br><br>
	You nod at that.<<npcincr Kylar love 1>><<glove "Kylar">>
<<case "Sydney">>
	Sydney is waiting in the lobby with a clean set of clothes folded across <<his>> arms.
	When <<he>> sees you, <<he>> walks over and offers them to you.
	<br><br>
	"I came as soon as they called," <<he>> says. "I brought something warm for you to wear.
	You don't need to hurry. We can leave when you're ready."
	<br><br>
	Sydney walks beside you on the way home and matches your pace. If your breathing becomes difficult,
	<<he>> stops with you and waits until you are ready to continue without trying to hurry you.
	<br><br>
	At the orphanage door, <<he>> touches your arm before leaning forward to kiss your cheek.
	"Please rest when you get inside," <<he>> says. "You can deal with everything else after you've recovered."
	<<npcincr Sydney love 1>><<glove "Sydney">>
<<case "Avery">>
	Avery is standing beside <<his>> car near the hospital entrance,
	holding <<his>> phone in one hand while checking the time on <<his>> watch.
	<br><br>
	When <<he>> sees you, <<he>> puts the phone away and opens the passenger door.
	"Get in. I left a meeting because the hospital called me. I would rather not have that happen again."
	<br><br>
	Avery starts the car once you are seated. <<He>> says little during the drive,
	though <<he>> glances towards you several times when the traffic slows.
	<br><br>
	When the car stops outside the orphanage, Avery looks through the window at the building before turning back to you.
	<br><br>
	"You shouldn't have to come back here after leaving hospital," <<he>> says. "Go inside and rest.
	And try to stay out of hospital from now on. I don't enjoy being told you've been hurt."
	<<npcincr Avery love 1>><<glove "Avery">>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<</widget>>
